{"id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction.md","title":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","display":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","aliases":["72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"],"display":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.3 §§3.1–3.3, ch.11; supplement Coquand–Huet 1988, §§2–3","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.3 §§3.1–3.3, ch.11; supplement Coquand–Huet 1988, §§2–3"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定互不相交的可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t,V_T\">\\(V_t,V_T\\)</span> 与构造标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V_t\">\\(x,y,z\\in V_t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V,W\\in V_T\">\\(U,V,W\\in V_T\\)</span>。以下语法为有限树的自由构造语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 是类型树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}\\)</span> 与所有标签、变量不交。各语法可取相应构造算子的有限迭代并集。</li>\n<li>通用项构造是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]\">\\(x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]\\)</span>；各具体系统只使用其明确允许的子语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 为无变量常元；STLC/F 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 把其体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 作为通用表达式。</li>\n<li>重命名式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T\">\\(q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T\\)</span> 同种类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 避开被操作树的全部变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in V_t\\cup V_T\">\\(v\\in V_t\\cup V_T\\)</span>。泛型类型语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\)</span> 由下式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in V_T\">\\(U,V\\in V_T\\)</span>，其中类型语法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{Base}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{Base}\\)</span>，其余公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 遍历所有无变量常元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 表示下列有限语法的带种类并集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 遍历种类正确的单孔树context；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X^2\">\\(R\\subseteq X^2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价类上解释。新变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 避开当前有限表达式及代入表达式的全部变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[x\\mapsto z]\">\\(E[x\\mapsto z]\\)</span> 表示仅将当前绑定者所绑定的出现改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，嵌套同名绑定者之下不改。此操作由有限树路径上的最近绑定者唯一确定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&amp;::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&amp;v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&amp;v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&amp;:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&amp;::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&amp;v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&amp;v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&amp;:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&amp;:=\\{U\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&amp;:=\\{U\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&amp;:=N,&amp; y[N/x]&amp;:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&amp;c[N/x]&amp;:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&amp;y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&amp;:=N,&amp; y[N/x]&amp;:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&amp;c[N/x]&amp;:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&amp;y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&amp;:=B,&amp; V[B/U]&amp;:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&amp;c[B/U]&amp;:=c,&amp;x[B/U]&amp;:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to C)[B/U]&amp;:=A[B/U]\\to C[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&amp;:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&amp;:=B,&amp; V[B/U]&amp;:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&amp;c[B/U]&amp;:=c,&amp;x[B/U]&amp;:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to C)[B/U]&amp;:=A[B/U]\\to C[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&amp;:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&amp;:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&amp;::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&amp;:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代入按有限树递归，改名后递归只进入原体的真子树；不同新变量选择产生相同α类，因此等式定义全函数。所有context只在给定子语法中合法时实例化。F的类型无内部归约；CoC的注解、Π域与Π体均有兼容归约。α关系取所示改名等式生成的最小兼容等价关系，而非原始字符串相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_t,V_T","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"U,V,W\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in V_t\\cup V_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"E[x\\mapsto z]","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&:=\\{x\\},&\\operatorname{FV}(c)&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&:=\\{U\\},&\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&:=\\varnothing,&\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&:=N,& y[N/x]&:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&c[N/x]&:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&:=B,& V[B/U]&:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&c[B/U]&:=c,&x[B/U]&:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to C)[B/U]&:=A[B/U]\\to C[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&::=[\\ ]\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6502,"backlinks":[{"id":"77d1a531e7662d98","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}$ 是不同常元，$V_t$、避免捕获代入、$\\beta_C$ 和 $=_{\\beta_C}$ 见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction|df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"},{"id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的有限树、α等价、避免捕获代入。$\\mathsf0$ 是类型标签，$\\mathbf0$ 是项常元，二者不同。每个类型 $\\sigma$ 有可数无限变量集 $V_\\sigma$，这些集合两两不交；$x^\\sigma\\in V_\\sigma$。有限上下文只给变量其固有类型。"},{"id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的有限自由树、$\\alpha$ 类及 $\\beta_\\lambda$。$\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing$，$\\mathsf{Var}=V_t$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"},{"id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的 $V_t,V_T$、$\\operatorname{FTV}$、两种避免捕获代入与 $\\beta_F$。$\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F$ 为有限偏函数。全部类型为开放类型，不设置额外kind层；$x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$ 才可扩充。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction|df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"},{"id":"a07a3ec2073ac7ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$ 遍历对应项语法的合法单孔context；自由变量函数及β关系见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction|72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":[]}